{"id":"9994e6e6c71d1a9c57a9042936c0b3765cb85338","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1245356","title":"AI 短剧已经把我锁死了","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"sport123","excerpt":"生活 - @sport123 - 感觉不少人沉迷了","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>感觉不少人沉迷了</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/短剧\"><li></li> 短剧</a><a href=\"/tag/沉迷\"><li></li> 沉迷</a></P><p><span>11 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-29 16:11:19 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18134946\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2605a993d9e87ce010e477f4b60a452f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wesker1999\" data-uid=\"626420\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wesker1999\">wesker1999</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-28 21:55:56 +08:00\">1 day ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>相比国内粗制滥造的垃圾电视剧，AI 短剧还是好太多了。100 部里挑一两部好看的都看不完。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18135442\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ecf2/830c/694607_normal.png?m=1790221169\" alt=\"lanyy10101\" data-uid=\"694607\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lanyy10101\">lanyy10101</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 09:05:54 +08:00\">13h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看剧最吸引人的还是剧情，画质其次，现在开始对那种周更的动漫没耐心了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18135546\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a525/be18/140559_normal.png?m=1720355410\" alt=\"auin\" data-uid=\"140559\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/auin\">auin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 09:24:27 +08:00\">12h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>AI 相比于传统影视剧、动画的制作方式简直是降维，不需要传统制作班子，只要编剧+AI 就能开工。<br>其实大家对画面质感、逻辑严谨性并没有那么高，只要剧情能吸引人就能火。<br>我也看了几部精品 AI 剧，体验很好，一刷到底。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18135839\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8870/f745/394257_normal.png?m=1719540574\" alt=\"ddhYr\" data-uid=\"394257\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ddhYr\">ddhYr</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 10:00:07 +08:00\">12h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>《持械入宋》好看</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18137210\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ed46/2613/459725_normal.png?m=1602912905\" alt=\"freeair\" data-uid=\"459725\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/freeair\">freeair</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 13:40:52 +08:00\">8h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>编剧情节，还有制作出来的效果，感觉在一直变好。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18137767\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5c95348d467de48afdf92026ddf30bff?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"skyfore\" data-uid=\"204356\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/skyfore\">skyfore</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 15:05:51 +08:00\">7h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感觉和小说一样，也是一个渐进的过程，以前看都市无脑文看得津津有味，现在感觉番茄上的小说都看不下去了，太低智了。不过有眼光的兄弟现在还是可以进场的，现在就是 AI 影视的小说时刻，先赚一波米再说。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18138211\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/40eaa45a823f075189ca2a4f76343678?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jackOff\" data-uid=\"593397\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jackOff\">jackOff</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-29 16:11:19 +08:00\">6h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>比电视剧题材丰富，不水时长，演技到位，有的妖魔鬼怪玻尿酸打的都快成伪人了，而且我对明星的 cp 或者私生饭行为非常反感，我只想看个让人能爽爽的东西，不想被其他内容影响心情</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"感觉不少人沉迷了 AI 短剧 沉迷11 replies • 2026-09-29 16:11:19 +08:00 1 wesker1999 1 day ago 1 相比国内粗制滥造的垃圾电视剧，AI 短剧还是好太多了。100 